        "content": "**Left: HTTP `POST /bookings`** (job `studyslot`)  \u00b7  **Right: gRPC `CreateBooking`** (job `studyslot-grpc`). Same operation, same business rules, same database. All durations are measured **on the server**. Rates and percentiles use a **1-minute window** (`[1m]`). Populate with `scripts/generate_traffic.py`."
